    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/28/Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240826235552\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Ikaruga Queen\u0026#39;s Blade ULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/28/Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240826235552\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"935\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga Queen\u0026#39;s Blade ULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cb\u003ePhoenix Conglomerate Ninja\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eIkaruga\u003c/b\u003e is a character from the Senran Kagura videogame series. She makes her debut in Senran Kagura: Portrait of Girls.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe is voiced by Asami Imai in the Japanese version, and by Alexis Tipton in the English version.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\"\u003eAppearance\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIkaruga%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eIkaruga\u003c/b\u003e is a refined girl with long black hair and flat cut bangs resting on her forehead. In her turnover outfit she wears a white gold-trimmed jacket with six buttons and a few tassels strewn across. On her left arm is a Hanzo school armband. She has a gold trimmed white skirt and boots of similar color scheme to her jacket, and has black tights underneath.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\"\u003ePersonality\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIkaruga%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eIkaruga\u003c/b\u003e hold the responcibility of being the leader of the Girl shinobi team. She is usually calm but gets agitated by \u003cb\u003eKatsuragi\u003c/b\u003e’s lecherous. Like \u003cb\u003eKatsuragi\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eIkaruga\u003c/b\u003e hides her sad past behind a cool exterior. But with the love of her fellow Shinobi friends, her pain has softened and she become more open. She loves cooking and enjoy traditional Japanese cuisine, going as far to make her own dishes.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/96/Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240826235653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Ikaruga S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade ULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/96/Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240826235653\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1037\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade ULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_S_Queen%27s_Blade_ULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f7/Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250626000917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Ikaruga Phoenix Conglomerate Ninja Master of Kouma Clan Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f7/Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250626000917\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"867\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ikaruga Phoenix Conglomerate Ninja Master of Kouma Clan Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ikaruga_Phoenix_Conglomerate_Ninja_Master_of_Kouma_Clan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260819222625\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node cou